  "name": "Infection Radius",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/unholy/orb-smoking-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 2nd level, you are surrounded by an invisible cloud of necrotic pathogens that are harmless until you unleash them on a creature nearby. When a creature you can see moves into a space within 10 feet of you or starts its turn there, you can command your pathogens to deal necrotic damage to that creature unless it succeeds on a Constitution saving throw against your creation save DC.</p>\n<p>The necrotic damage scales with level: 1d6 at 2nd, 1d8 at 6th, 1d10 at 10th, and 1d12 at 14th level.</p>",
